<heading>grants account add - Grant a permission to an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  add NAME PERMISSION
  add NAME PERMISSION --bits rwx
  add NAME PERMISSION --deny
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Grants a permission to an account. Use --bits to control
read/write/execute access and --deny to explicitly forbid
an action.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
add admin /crm/contact/edit --bits r
  Grant the admin account read access to /crm/contact/edit.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
account/show, account/remove, group/add, permission/show
</paragraph>
